#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/geofence.rst:5
#: 3ba923052ffa48a0b080e40af04d9769
msgid "The geofence represents a hard limit to where the UAV will not fly beyond. It is useful for preventing runaway UAVs (barring other software/hardware issues). If it breaches the fence the failsafe will be activated, returning it to the home point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/geofence.rst:10
#: 0c5407e546a04055a530c46af2bedd52
msgid "It is represented as an arbitrary polygon of waypoints around the flying area in a fixed-wing vehicle. In ArduCopter, it is a radius and altitude parameter(s) representing a cylinder around the flying area."
msgstr ""

